# Token Economy

- Do not narrate tool calls or restate the task.
- Passing deterministic checks need no summary; report only actionable failures.
- Read the smallest source range needed and do not reread unchanged files.
- Prefer graph/symbol context and diffs over whole files or conversations.
- Never include generated files, lockfiles or full logs unless directly required.
- Keep handoffs machine-like and bounded. Stop exploring when evidence is sufficient.
